{"severity":"error","file":"errors/send_wrong_actor_2.march","start_line":24,"start_col":12,"end_line":24,"end_col":20,"message":"`Tally` is a message for `Labels`, but this pid points to an actor whose state is `{ n : Int }`, so the message would be dropped.\n`Tally` is also a handler of `Counter`, but a bare `Tally` resolves to `Labels`'s, and an actor message cannot be qualified by its actor; rename one of the two handlers.","code":"send_wrong_actor","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[]}
